      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been having this weird burning sensation in the middle of my chest lately. it's not too bad, but it usually kicks in when i'm walking up stairs or moving around a lot, then it just goes away if i sit down for a minute. i'm guessing it's just some bad heartburn or acid reflux... do you think it's okay if i just take some antacids to deal with it?",
